    "lyrics": [
      {
        "part": "Tenor I",
        "verses": 1
      }
    ],
    "notes": "Closed male-voice score: Tenor I + Tenor II on a treble-8vb staff (sounding an octave below the written treble pitch), Baritone + Bass on a bass staff -> FOUR parts with lyrics on Tenor I.  Stanza 1 (bars 1-8) in Gb major (6 flats), stanza 2 (bars 9-16) in F# major (6 sharps) - the SAME sounding melody respelled; the change at bar 9 is mid-system and LilyPond prints 6 naturals + 6 sharps.  Coda (bars 17-20) in D major (4 cancelling naturals).  Chromatic chords give Ebb (Cb minor, bar 5), C natural (Ab7), B# (G#7), F## (D#7), D natural (B minor), E and D naturals (E7), Bb (G minor).  Every Tenor I/II pitch must be one octave below the written treble position (clef-octave-change -1)."
  },
